  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 103.02 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 310-A:81, I, the board shall consist of 7 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 310-A:81, I and II.\n\nSource. #4676, eff 9-20-89, EXPIRED: 9-20-95\n\nNew. #6231, eff 4-26-96; ss by #8006, eff 12-18-03; ss by #14535, eff 4-1-26",
